    <item>
      <title>Agentic AI重塑跨境支付：PayPal的智能枢纽战略与“代理式商业”的未来图景</title>
      <link>http://192.168.50.247:1313/insights/agentic-aipaypal-20250916161005045-2/</link>
      <pubDate>Tue, 16 Sep 2025 16:10:05 +0800</pubDate>
